{"created": "2026-08-20T12:48:25.395067+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-15T00:02:00.853476+00:00", "id": 22029209, "conceptrecid": "22029208", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22029209", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22029208", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22029209", "metadata": {"title": "Subnational European Environmental Infringements (SEEI) Dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22029209", "publication_date": "2026-08-20", "description": "<p>Original dataset gathered on subnational infringement data. Based on qualitative content analysis of European infringement documents (i.e., Reasoned opinions and Fiches) requested from the European Commission via Freedom of Information requests. The infringements range data from 2005 to 2018 and include 28 countries, within which there are approximately 360 subnational authorities. The dataset includes a binary count of infringements per year, per subnational authority, as well as the count of infringement(s) per year and subnational authority (e.g., bad application or incorrect/incomplete transposition). Further notes on the infringed directive(s) are also included.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Data associated with the following publications:</p>\n<p>Wilhelm, M. T. (2025). Subnational trouble? Party system nationalisation, issue salience, and capacity constraints in Spain&acute; s infringements of European environmental directives. South European Society and Politics, 30(2), 257-289. DOI: 10.1080/13608746.2025.2490896.</p>\n<p>Wilhelm, M. T. (2026). Green matters? The effects of green party support, autonomy and capacity on subnational environmental infringements.&nbsp;<em>Regional &amp; Federal Studies</em>,&nbsp;<em>36</em>(2), 265-296. DOI: 10.1080/13597566.2025.2486623.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wilhelm, M.T. (Forthcoming) Echoes of the Public: Public Opinion and Subnational Compliance with European Environmental Directives. <em>European Union Politics</em>. DOI: 10.1177/14651165261471485.&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "embargo_date": "2026-09-15", "creators": [{"name": "Wilhelm, Marie-Th\u00e9r\u00e8se", "affiliation": "University of Oslo", "orcid": "0000-0001-8616-9621"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22029208"}}]}}, "title": "Subnational European Environmental Infringements (SEEI) Dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22029209", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22029209?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22029209", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22029209", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22029209", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029208", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22029208", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22029208", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22029208", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22029209/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22029209/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22029209/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22029209/access", "communities": "http